  "overview": "Nchịkọta",
  "preMonsoonOverviewText": "Mpaghara ọrụ ugbo cashew Naịjirịa na-enweta ike ọrịa kachasị elu n'afọ ozugbo udu mmiri malitere, na-abụkarị n'ọnwa Eprel. Anthracnose, Gumosis, na Red Rust niile na-eto n'ọnọdụ okpomọkụ, iru mmiri, na mmiri ozuzo na-esote — mgbe mgbaàmà ọ pụtara ìhè, ọgwụgwọ abụrụla nke a na-achụso azụ. Nduzi a kwuru banyere nkwadebe ndị ọrụ ugbo kwesịrị imecha n'ọnwa Maachị, tupu udu mmiri amalite, ka osisi gị banye n'oge udu mmiri na ike ọrịa ebelataworị.",
